<title>SOUTH AFRICA: KAGISO'S MOLOBI APPOINTED TO LIBERTY BOARDS.</title>
<headline>KAGISO'S MOLOBI APPOINTED TO LIBERTY BOARDS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Liberty Life Group Ltd said on Tuesday Eric Molobi, chairman of Kagiso Trust Investment Co Ltd, would join the boards of three group companies with effect from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Liberty said in a statement Molobi would sit on the boards of Liberty Life Association of Africa Ltd, Liberty Holdings Ltd and First International Trust Ltd .</p>
<p>The group said Liberty Life announced in August last year that it had invested 50 million rand in Kagiso, the investment arm of the Kagiso Trust, which it said was South Africa's largest non government organisation.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
